{"id":"69e3b28dcc6d43ac","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-lebesgue-density.md","title":"Cantor空间的Lebesgue密度定理","display":"thm-lebesgue-density — Cantor空间的Lebesgue密度定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-lebesgue-density","aliases":["43-thm-lebesgue-density"],"display":"thm-lebesgue-density — Cantor空间的Lebesgue密度定理","depends_on":["[[43-df-density-tail]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 4.2.3, print pp.4–5 / PDF pp.24–25","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-lebesgue-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-lebesgue-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lebesgue-density — Cantor空间的Lebesgue密度定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b793f1206588410b\" href=\"?note=b793f1206588410b\" title=\"43-df-density-tail\">43-df-density-tail</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 4.2.3, print pp.4–5 / PDF pp.24–25"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\triangle F\">\\(E\\triangle F\\)</span>为对称差。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b793f1206588410b\" href=\"?note=b793f1206588410b\" title=\"43-df-density-tail\">43-df-density-tail</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Xi(E)\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\land\\mu(E\\triangle\\Xi(E))=0,\\qquad\\mu(\\Xi(E))=\\mu(E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Xi(E)\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\land\\mu(E\\triangle\\Xi(E))=0,\\qquad\\mu(\\Xi(E))=\\mu(E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源证明通过一系列测度高于局部相对密度上界的柱集反证；本次核对陈述与柱集测度参数。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.2.3, print pp.4–5 / PDF pp.24–25。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-density-tail","status":"resolved","id":"b793f1206588410b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-density-tail]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-density-tail","status":"resolved","id":"b793f1206588410b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-density-tail]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-density-tail]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\triangle F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Xi(E)\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\land\\mu(E\\triangle\\Xi(E))=0,\\qquad\\mu(\\Xi(E))=\\mu(E).","display":true}],"bytes":1086,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-lebesgue-density]] — Cantor空间的Lebesgue密度定理"},{"id":"00a1afe6095bcabc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["b793f1206588410b","ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}